              <tr><td class="label">논문명</td><td><strong>Curation and Audience Interaction in Digital Art Exhibitions</strong></td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">저자</td><td>Beryl Graham, Sarah Cook</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">발행기관</td><td>MIT Press (Rethinking Curating)</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">발행연도</td><td>2010년</td></tr>
